    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128475635\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Baptism of</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475636\" id=\"p1\">cometh Jesus … unto John, to be <span class=\"key-word\">baptized</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">Matt. 3:13</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Mark 1:9</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p21#p21\">Luke 3:21</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p27#p27\">1 Ne. 11:27</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475637\" id=\"p2\">can ye … be <span class=\"key-word\">baptized</span> with the <span class=\"key-word\">baptism</span> that I am <span class=\"key-word\">baptized</span> with, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p38#p38\">Mark 10:38</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475638\" id=\"p3\">I saw the <span class=\"key-word\">Spirit</span> descending … it abode upon him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p32#p32\">John 1:32</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475639\" id=\"p4\">in Bethabara … he should <span class=\"key-word\">baptize</span> with water, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">1 Ne. 10:9</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475640\" id=\"p5\">if the Lamb of God … should have need to be <span class=\"key-word\">baptized</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/31?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">2 Ne. 31:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
